---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
---
<Layout title="Ventures" description="Our current work includes opportunities in AI infrastructure and governance technology.">
  <PageIntro label="Our current work" title="Ventures"><p>Tarian Ventures researches, tests and pilots new business ideas. The intention is to establish viable ventures as independent companies; others are changed or stopped.</p></PageIntro>
  <div class="shell venture-list">
    <section class="venture-row"><div><p class="eyebrow">AI infrastructure</p><h2>Tarian Compute</h2><p class="status">Research and early conversations</p></div><div class="prose"><p class="lead">Tarian Compute is exploring opportunities within the next generation of UK digital and AI infrastructure.</p><p>Compute is our current priority. We are investigating power, connectivity, sites, delivery requirements and future demand.</p><a class="text-link" href="/compute/">Explore Tarian Compute <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
    <section class="venture-row" id="altgrc"><div><p class="eyebrow">Governance technology</p><h2>AltGRC</h2><p class="status">In development</p></div><div class="prose"><p class="lead">AltGRC is a governance, risk and resilience platform being developed to make complex organisational governance easier to understand and operate.</p><p>The demonstration brings together risk, controls, assurance, resilience and related governance activities within a common operating model.</p><p>AltGRC is in development and being refined through demonstrations and practitioner feedback. Further work is needed before customer deployment.</p><a class="text-link" href="/contact/#altgrc">Talk to us about AltGRC <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
    <section class="venture-row"><h2>New Ventures</h2><div class="prose"><p class="lead">Tarian Ventures continuously investigates new opportunities created by technological, regulatory, demographic and market change.</p><p>Ideas do not automatically become businesses. We test the underlying problem, market, economics and execution assumptions before committing serious time and money.</p><p>Where an opportunity survives that process, we build.</p></div></section>
  </div>
</Layout>
